{"id":"vafxm1viqdvem219bi4ofsf7l","title":"中金：维持美联储12月加息25个基点的基准判断","originalTitle":null,"summary":"中金公司维持12月加息25个基点的基准判断。报告指出美国10月CPI季调环比上涨0.4%（上月0.6%），核心CPI环比连续第三个月上涨0.3%（上月0.3%），均高于市场预期。中金认为美联储政策未明显落后于通胀曲线，叠加金融条件已边际收紧，加速加息必要性不强。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"界面新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15318498.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T00:42:20.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T01:14:30.264Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T01:14:30.264Z","category":"macro","tags":["研究报告","美联储","通胀"],"score":72,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"051a601b-e669-45f2-a026-316586ce20ac","title":"中金维持美联储12月加息25基点判断，通胀数据高于预期但加息必要性存分歧"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"jianli@jiemian.com(界面快报)","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"051a601b-e669-45f2-a026-316586ce20ac","title":"中金维持美联储12月加息25基点判断，通胀数据高于预期但加息必要性存分歧"}],"topics":[{"slug":"rates","name":"利率与流动性"},{"slug":"inflation","name":"通胀与就业"},{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f4kZhmrBIOZ0","reportCount":2,"additionalSourceCount":1},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}